  - key: ui.finishedRepair.title
    value: Restoration Complete!
  - key: ui.finishedRepair.continue
    value: Continue
  - key: ui.finishedRepair.backToWorkbench
    value: Go back to workbench
  - key: ui.dialogue.tapToContinue
    value: tap to continue
  - key: ui.dialogue.advance
    value: Tap to advance the dialogue
  - key: ui.pause.title
    value: GAME PAUSED
  - key: ui.pause.resume
    value: Continue Restoration
  - key: ui.pause.quit
    value: Quit
  - key: ui.thanks.title
    value: The end?
  - key: ui.thanks.body
    value: 'Thank you for testing the game! Sorry it''s so short: we''re still in
      development and fine-tuning the key parts of the gameplay. Future updates will
      bring more posters and a mysterious story for you! While you wait for us to
      build more of the game, how about sending us some feedback? Found a bug? Have
      an idea to improve the gameplay? I''m all ears!'
  - key: ui.thanks.continue
    value: Continue
  - key: tool.dustRemover
    value: Duster
  - key: tool.waterSpray
    value: Water spray
  - key: tool.deacidifier
    value: Deacidifier
  - key: tool.squeegee
    value: Squeegee
  - key: tool.roller
    value: Glue roller
  - key: tool.pencil
    value: Pencil
  - key: poster.poster01.title
    value: Visit Lethe Falls
  - key: stage.dust.title
    value: Dusting off
  - key: stage.dust.prompt
    value: Sweep the duster over the whole poster until the dust is gone.
  - key: stage.wash.title
    value: Washing
  - key: stage.wash.prompt
    value: Spray water until the whole poster is covered.
  - key: stage.deacidify.title
    value: Deacidifying
  - key: stage.deacidify.prompt
    value: Spread the deacidifier so the paper turns white again.
  - key: stage.squeegee.title
    value: Time to dry
  - key: stage.squeegee.prompt
    value: Slide the squeegee from side to side to push the water out.
  - key: stage.adhesive.title
    value: Rolling, rolling!
  - key: stage.adhesive.prompt
    value: Roll glue over the whole back of the poster.
  - key: stage.mend.title
    value: Final touches
  - key: stage.mend.prompt
    value: Use the pencil to fill in the missing bits.
  - key: tutorial.welcome
    value: Hi, hi! So glad to see you here. I'm Tracy, and this is the Restorium
      Emporium. Shall we bring a very old poster back to life?
  - key: tutorial.tapRestore
    value: Our first job is right here in the journal. Tap Restore and let's begin.
  - key: tutorial.pickDustRemover
    value: First, the dust. Pick up the duster from the toolbar.
  - key: tutorial.useDustRemover
    value: Now slide your finger over the poster, nice and slow, until all the dust
      is gone.
  - key: tutorial.pickWaterSpray
    value: Very good! Now pick up the water spray.
  - key: tutorial.useWaterSpray
    value: Dampen the whole poster. No rush, the paper will thank you.
  - key: tutorial.pickDeacidifier
    value: The paper has yellowed over time. Grab the deacidifier and we'll fix that.
  - key: tutorial.useDeacidifier
    value: Spread it everywhere and watch the white come back. This is my favourite
      part.
  - key: tutorial.pickSqueegee
    value: Time to dry. The squeegee, please.
  - key: tutorial.useSqueegee
    value: Slide the squeegee from side to side to push out the leftover water.
  - key: tutorial.pickRoller
    value: I flipped the poster over for you. Now pick up the glue roller.
  - key: tutorial.useRoller
    value: "Roll glue over the whole back \u2014 that's what will hold the poster
      to the linen."
  - key: tutorial.pickPencil
    value: Almost there! Pick up the pencil.
  - key: tutorial.usePencil
    value: Now lovingly fill in the little pieces that got lost along the way.
  - key: tutorial.congrats
    value: "Look at that! It's beautiful. And the job earned us a few coins, too
      \u2014 see them there?"
  - key: tutorial.tapContinue
    value: Tap Continue and let's head to my workshop. There's something I want to
      show you!
  - key: ui.cutscene.skipHint
    value: Tap to skip
  - key: stage.stickers.title
    value: Peel them off!
  - key: stage.stickers.prompt
    value: Looks like someone tried to fix this poster before... Tap each piece of
      tape to peel it off.
  - key: poster.poster01.chapter
    value: Ch1 - Lethe Falls Tourism Poster
  - key: poster.poster02.title
    value: Eternal Theatre
  - key: poster.poster02.chapter
    value: Ch2 - Eternal Theatre Cinema Program
  - key: ui.desk.selected
    value: 'Selected: {0}'
  - key: ui.desk.desc
    value: 'Desc.: {0}'
  - key: ui.edit.title
    value: Edit Mode
  - key: ui.edit.hint
    value: Select an item to edit its position.
  - key: ui.edit.dragHint
    value: Click and drag around the item to position it
  - key: ui.edit.place
    value: Place Item
  - key: ui.edit.undo
    value: Undo
  - key: ui.edit.or
    value: or
  - key: ui.edit.backToWorkshop
    value: Back to workshop
  - key: ui.preview.title
    value: Preview Mode
  - key: ui.preview.dragHint
    value: Click and drag around the item to position it
  - key: ui.preview.price
    value: 'Price: {0} coins'
  - key: ui.preview.buy
    value: Buy Item
  - key: ui.preview.giveUp
    value: Give up
  - key: ui.preview.notEnoughCoins
    value: Not enough coins yet... restoring another poster should help!
  - key: ui.shop.back
    value: Go back to workbench
  - key: ui.shop.titleTop
    value: Tracy's
  - key: ui.shop.titleMain
    value: Emporium Shop
  - key: ui.shop.removeAds
    value: Remove ads
  - key: ui.shop.buyMoreCoins
    value: Buy More Coins
  - key: ui.shop.tabDecor
    value: "D\xE9cor"
  - key: ui.shop.tabMisc
    value: Misc.
  - key: ui.shop.owned
    value: Owned
  - key: ui.shop.empty
    value: More items coming soon!
  - key: shop.item.lamp.name
    value: Lamp
  - key: shop.item.lamp.desc
    value: A warm, bright lamp for the workbench. With light like this, you'll never
      miss that a poster is a fake again!
  - key: shop.item.plant.name
    value: Plant Pot
  - key: shop.item.plant.desc
    value: "This pretty plant pot d\xE9cor was found at a store near the workshop,
      it's really pretty!"
  - key: shop.item.books.name
    value: Book Pile
  - key: shop.item.books.desc
    value: You've recently gotten into reading mystery books about time travel, so
      you got yourself a pile to keep at the workshop!
  - key: ui.pause.journal
    value: Journal
  - key: ui.pause.settings
    value: Settings
  - key: ui.pause.flavour
    value: Take your time, Mysteries that lie behind these papers shall wait for
      your return.
  - key: ui.settings.title
    value: SETTINGS
  - key: ui.settings.tracyLine
    value: Oh, the restorium needs adjusting? My bad, let's change it right away!
  - key: ui.settings.language
    value: Language
  - key: ui.settings.sfx
    value: SFX Audio
  - key: ui.settings.music
    value: Music Audio
  - key: ui.settings.resetProgress
    value: Reset progress
  - key: ui.settings.resetConfirm
    value: Erase all progress? Your coins, decorations and restored posters will
      be lost.
  - key: ui.settings.resetYes
    value: Erase
  - key: ui.settings.resetNo
    value: Cancel
  - key: ui.journal.continue
    value: Continue
  - key: ui.journal.restored
    value: Restored
  - key: ui.journal.back
    value: Go back to workbench
  - key: ui.journal.lockedHint
    value: Restore the previous poster first
  - key: ui.finishedRepair.double
    value: Double Reward
  - key: ui.finishedRepair.or
    value: or
  - key: ui.finishedRepair.coins
    value: +{0}
  - key: tutorial.deskhub_lamp.welcome
    value: Welcome to my workshop! This is where the magic happens... well, most
      of it.
  - key: tutorial.deskhub_lamp.dark
    value: Hmm... it's awfully dark over this desk, isn't it? I really need a new
      lamp.
  - key: tutorial.deskhub_lamp.fake
    value: Maybe that's why I didn't notice the last poster was a fake... With lighting
      this poor, anyone could have missed it! Right?
  - key: tutorial.deskhub_lamp.tapShop
    value: Let's pick one out! Tap the bag to open the shop.
  - key: tutorial.deskhub_lamp.tapLamp
    value: "Ooh, that lamp is perfect \u2014 and the coins you just earned cover
      it exactly. Tap it!"
  - key: tutorial.deskhub_lamp.drag
    value: Here's how it would look! Drag it wherever you like on the desk.
  - key: tutorial.deskhub_lamp.buy
    value: Happy with the spot? Tap Buy Item and it's ours!
  - key: tutorial.deskhub_lamp.happy
    value: Much better! Now I can finally see every little detail.
  - key: tutorial.deskhub_lamp.editMode
    value: If you ever want to move things around, just tap this button to enter
      edit mode.
  - key: tutorial.deskhub_lamp.tapBook
    value: "Now, let's open the journal. Tap the book \u2014 I have a feeling new
      work has arrived."
  - key: tutorial.journal_page2.newPoster
    value: Look! A new poster arrived while we were busy.
  - key: tutorial.journal_page2.nextPage
    value: Tap the arrow to turn the page.
  - key: tutorial.journal_page2.restore
    value: There it is. Tap Restore whenever you're ready.
  - key: tutorial.stickers.explain
    value: Oh dear, someone covered this poster in stickers! We'll have to peel them
      off one by one.
  - key: tutorial.stickers.peel
    value: Tap a sticker to peel it off. Gently!
  - key: tutorial.stickers.rest
    value: Just like that! Now the rest of them.
  - key: ui.pause.continue
    value: Continue
  - key: ui.coins.title
    value: The Golden Vault
  - key: ui.coins.pack
    value: '{0} coins | {1}'
  - key: ui.coins.finePrint
    value: charged to your account. Restore purchases any time from Settings
  - key: ui.coins.terms
    value: Terms
  - key: ui.coins.privacy
    value: Privacy
  - key: ui.coins.removeAds
    value: Remove Ads
  - key: ui.coins.failed
    value: The purchase didn't go through. Please try again.
  - key: ui.coins.unavailable
    value: The store isn't available right now.
